+This prepares an Apple Silicon `.app` with its own Node and Chromium, then creates a DMG using macOS's `hdiutil`. Outputs are under `out/`; no terminal or global Node/Chrome installation is required to run the packaged app. Its Library is in macOS application user data, separate from the development project. Use **Library → saved-location details → Import an existing Reframe Library** to copy an existing project Library.
 
